            <title>[KYLIN-5409] When hdfs permissions are insufficient, the building job&apos;s task should not be retried</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5409</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When hdfs permissions are insufficient, building job fails after many retries.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And failed information like:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When building job retry, throw exception: org.apache.spark.autoheal.ExceptionTerminator#incMemory NoSuchElementException&lt;/p&gt;

